    {
      "key": "worlds",
      "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: production 2x2 background atlas for a premium Korean toddler game. Make one square 2048x2048 image divided into EXACT equal four 1024x1024 square scenes, no borders or gutters, no text anywhere. Style: high-end soft 3D animated children's movie, warm sunlight, dimensional rounded forms, realistic soft wood and fabric textures, sweet pastel mint/cream/peach/sky blue, beautifully rendered, no flat vector art. Each quadrant is a separate full scene framed so that the lower half is open space for interactive game objects. TOP LEFT: a delightful little pedestrian village square, three small shops: fruit grocery with red-striped awning at left, cozy kitchen cottage center, pastel mint veterinary clinic right, green trees and flowers, welcoming paths, no cars. TOP RIGHT: interior of a cozy premium mini grocery store, wooden shelves framing sides, distant pastel produce and bread, sunny window, empty central counter and floor, no people. BOTTOM LEFT: a beautiful home kitchen with mint cabinets, rounded sunny window, warm wood countertop, sink on left, blank chopping work area center, stove right, empty central foreground. BOTTOM RIGHT: a comforting toy veterinary clinic, mint cabinets, rounded window, clean cream examination table centered, tiny paw sign without text, shelves of pastel jars in back, no people and no animals, ample uncluttered foreground. Match camera height and gentle light throughout. These will be cropped by exact quadrants for backgrounds; keep contents completely inside their own quadrant. No lettering, words, labels, watermarks, UI or emojis."
    },
    {
      "key": "food",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: 4 by 4 sprite atlas, one square 2048x2048 illustration, sixteen EXACT equal cells, no drawn grid, each subject isolated centered with wide margin on a pure white background. Premium dimensional 3D children's game art, tactile realistic textures, subtle warm contact shadow, rounded soft shapes, appetizing natural food colors, directional soft studio lighting, not flat vector or emoji. All sprites fully contained within their square cell. Row 1 left to right: shiny red apple with green leaf; yellow banana bunch; pale blue milk carton with small cow picture but NO letters; loaf of sliced white bread. Row 2: orange carrot with green top; two eggs one cracked shell; wedge of Swiss cheese; purple grape bunch. Row 3: pale green pear; cereal bowl with little blank box; yogurt cup; orange juice in clear glass with straw. Row 4: red tomato; mushroom; broccoli; yellow sweetcorn. No text, no numbers, no captions, no borders, no extra unrelated items. Equal 4x4 exact layout for automated slicing."
    },
    {
      "key": "objects",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Production sprite atlas for a premium toddler game. Single square 2048x2048 image, EXACT 5 by 5 equally sized cells, each isolated 3D object centered with generous clear padding against pure white. No grid lines. Consistent high-end animated movie prop art, soft realistic material textures and gentle lighting, pastel colors and tiny contact shadows, no flat vectors or emoji. Read the ordered subjects precisely. Row 1: blue stethoscope; digital thermometer; pink adhesive bandage; wooden hairbrush; clear glass of water. Row 2: small dog biscuit; brown potato; teal frying pot; ceramic soup bowl; wooden cutting board. Row 3: toy red car; blue toy boat; white toy airplane; colorful toy steam train; striped beach ball. Row 4: teddy bear; yellow rubber duck; small songbird; fluffy black-white cow; butterfly. Row 5: orange goldfish; leafy green tree; sunflower; glowing golden star; warm smiling sun. Everything inside its own equal cell, no lettering, no text, no labels, no border."
    },
    {
      "key": "characters",
      "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Production character sprite atlas, one square 2048x2048 image containing EXACT 3x3 equal panels. All subjects centered fully visible with generous margins on pure white background, no borders. Soft premium 3D animated children's movie rendering with fine hair/fur and fabric textures, gentle warm lighting, adorable expressive faces. Same Korean toddler boy (three-year-old, tousled brown hair, large brown eyes, cream hoodie with small bear applique and blue shorts) in first FIVE cells. Row 1: boy smiling joyfully; same boy sad with drooping eyebrows and small frown; same boy frustrated with knitted eyebrows and folded arms. Row 2: same boy frightened, worried eyes and hands by mouth; same boy surprised, raised eyebrows and round mouth; cute fluffy caramel and white puppy sitting. Row 3: gentle lilac-gray kitten sitting; cute cream rabbit sitting; same boy and his mother sharing a comforting hug. All full-body portraits, clear emotional distinctions suitable for three-year-olds, kind not scary. Do not add text, symbols, emoji, speech bubbles, captions or grid."
    },
